<title>EGYPT: Egypt interbank rates ease in liquid week-end mkt.</title>
<headline>Egypt interbank rates ease in liquid week-end mkt.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound eased on Thursday in a liquid end-of-week private market to between eight and 8-1/4 percent from between 8-1/2 and 8-3/4 percent on Tuesday, bankers said.</p>
<p>Banks were closed on Wednesday for a public holiday.</p>
<p>One-week rates were also slightly lower at between 8-1/8 and 8-3/8 percent from 8-1/2 and 8-5/8 percent on Tuesday, the bankers added.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom + 202 578 3290/1</p>
